WorldGen.SurfaceCasino: Building the casino

NPCs: {
	HowToPlay: How to play

	RouletteCroupier: {
		DisplayName: Croupier
		Chat: {
			0: Place your bets, place your bets! The wheel waits for no one.
			1: Zero is green, and green is the house's favourite colour.
			2: I've seen people bet their last silver on 17. I've also seen them walk home.
			3: The ball has no memory. Red ten times in a row means nothing. Probably.
			4: Lovely evening for losing money, isn't it? I mean, winning. Definitely winning.
			5: Tips are appreciated. So are platinum coins.
		}
		Help:
			'''
			Click a field to put your chip there, right-click to take it back.
			A single number pays 35 to 1. A dozen or a column pays 2 to 1.
			Red, black, odd, even, 1-18 and 19-36 pay 1 to 1. Zero loses all of those.
			Press Spin and pray.
			'''
	}

	BlackjackDealer: {
		DisplayName: Dealer
		Chat: {
			0: Get closer to 21 than me without going over. Simple. Painful, but simple.
			1: Always split aces and eights. Never split tens. Trust me, I've watched.
			2: The dealer stands on 17. I don't make the rules. Well, I do, but I don't make them.
			3: Six decks in the shoe. Counting them won't help. Probably.
			4: Hit me? Sir, this is a card game.
			5: If you see me smile at 16, that's just my face.
		}
		Help:
			'''
			Pick chips for your bet and press Deal.
			Hit draws a card, Stand keeps your hand. Go over 21 and you bust.
			Double: double your bet, take exactly one more card.
			Split: two cards of the same value become two hands.
			Blackjack (an ace and a ten) pays 3 to 2. I stand on 17.
			'''
	}

	Bartender: {
		DisplayName: Bartender
		Chat: {
			0: Drinks are on the house! Kidding. Drinks are on you.
			1: Nobody ever won a hand sober. Nobody ever won a hand drunk either.
			2: That guest over there lost a house last week. Literally. He bet his house.
			3: A little Ale helps the losses go down smooth.
			4: Have you tried the Cream Soda? Tastes like a jackpot.
			5: I keep a bucket behind the bar for tears. It's full.
		}
	}

	CasinoGuest: {
		DisplayName: Gambler
		Chat: {
			0: One more spin. Just one. Then I go home. Probably.
			1: I'm not addicted, I'm invested.
			2: My system is foolproof. I double my bet every time I lose. What could go wrong?
			3: Red is due. Red has to be due.
			4: I came here with a gold coin and a dream. Now I just have the dream.
			5: Don't tell my wife I'm here. She thinks I'm fighting the Eye of Cthulhu.
			6: Ninety-nine percent of gamblers quit right before they win big!
			7: I had a feeling about 13. The feeling was wrong.
			8: The house always wins? Then I'll buy the house!
			9: Lend me ten silver? I'll pay you back twice. Three times! Maybe.
			10: I sold my pickaxe for chips. Mining is for people without a plan.
			11: Lucky charm? I've got seven of them. They're not working.
		}
		Overhead: {
			0: Come on, red!
			1: Just one more...
			2: Daddy needs new boots!
			3: I can feel it!
			4: Not again!
			5: All in!
			6: Hit me!
			7: Easy money!
			8: Where did my coins go?
			9: Lucky number 7!
		}
	}
}

